# ── Project identity ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# correctness-testing is an in-process fault-injection harness, NOT a Docker/Ansible
# benchmark. These identity vars exist ONLY so `make correctness-testing build-binary`
# is discoverable/CI-registerable. The local / remote-docker / remote-bare modes are
# intentionally NOT wired for this project (see rust/README.md). Tests run via:
#     cd rust && cargo nextest run
PROJECT_NAME=correctness-testing
IMAGE_NAME=correctness-testing
BINARY_NAME=correctness_testing
RUST_SRC_RELPATH=../rust
